+## 3b. keybindings — 快捷键与硬件手势 ✅
+
+```json
+{
+  "contributes": {
+    "keybindings": [
+      {
+        "command": "com.berrytrace.plugin.voice-agents:start-listening",
+        "title": "Voice Agent 对话唤醒",
+        "key": "Option+Space",
+        "gesture": "combo:fn+space",
+        "scope": "global",
+        "when": "global"
+      }
+    ]
+  }
+}
+```
+
+| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |
+|------|------|------|
+| `command` | `string` | 绑定的命令 ID |
+| `title` | `string` | 快捷键说明标题 |
+| `key` / `mac` / `win` | `string` | 默认快捷键 (如 `"Option+Space"`) |
+| `gesture` | `string` | 绑定的 C++ / 硬件手势 (如 `"combo:fn+space"`) |
+| `scope` | `"global"` \| `"in-app"` \| `"editor"` | **作用域分类**：`"global"` (OS 系统级全局热键)、`"in-app"` (仅应用聚焦时)、`"editor"` (特定视图上下文) |
+| `when` | `string` | 触发上下文条件表达式 (如 `"editorTextFocus"`, `"global"`) |
+
+宿主在启动与插件挂载时加载默认 `keybindings`，并通过用户本地缓存 (`user_keybindings.json`) 形成最高强度的 SSOT 覆盖机制。
